dyno report: summarize the stored runs

Usage: dyno report [options]

Options:
  --cache modes        comma-separated cache modes: miss, continue, prefix
  --db path            database path (default /home/max/.local/share/token-rate/bench.db)
  --group dimensions   comma-separated dimensions: model, digest, server, workload, mode, tag, day, week, session (default model, digest, server, workload, mode)
  --model names        comma-separated model names
  --plain              a plain table, also in a terminal
  --prompt names       comma-separated prompt names
  --session IDs        comma-separated session IDs
  --since day          first day (YYYY-MM-DD) or time (RFC 3339)
  --tag tags           comma-separated tags
  --until day          last day (YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive) or time (RFC 3339, exclusive)
  -h, --help           show this help
